        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;One row per identity, one column per resource by access plane. A cell shows the level after the plan, and what the plan changed to get there.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read a row: everything an identity can do. Read a column: who can touch a resource. A workload column touched by another project&amp;#39;s identity is a leak.&lt;br&gt;Not verified: the policy of the CMP&amp;#39;s Vault token (drawn as the root token, the worst case) and the scope of its Cloudflare token (G15, G16). Plan phases: P1 root accounts, P2 CMP rights, P3 tenant isolation, P4 cloud accounts.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
